## 5. Compliance and termination

The permissions granted here are conditional on compliance. They terminate upon
breach. For a first breach, they are reinstated if You cease the prohibited activity
and remedy the breach within 30 days after receiving written notice, including
reasonable corrective attribution where applicable. Reinstatement does not
retroactively authorize prohibited commercial use or AI training or eliminate
liability for past conduct. Other reinstatement requires written permission.

Compliant recipients do not lose their own permissions solely because a distributor
breached these terms. The Licensor may offer separate terms for particular uses.

